+## PCH-002 — Fix stale keyboard/gameplay ownership after session termination
+
+- [x] Preserve the existing fail-closed library ownership lookup.
+- [x] Notify the existing shortcut-ownership refresh path after `session.exited`.
+- [x] Notify the existing shortcut-ownership refresh path after `session.crashed`.
+- [x] Notify the existing shortcut-ownership refresh path after `session.failed`.
+- [x] Notify the existing shortcut-ownership refresh path after an explicit stop result reaches a terminal state.
+- [x] Clear stale gameplay-input ownership without requiring the user to manually refocus the window.
