+## PCH-007 — Qualification protocol
+
+- [x] Define that exact branch-head `Tauri project` CI must pass before promotion.
+- [x] Define that exact branch-head `Tauri security` CI must pass before promotion.
+- [x] Define that applicable documentation/package workflows must be green or intentionally not triggered by path filters.
+- [x] Define that promotion to `master` must use a qualified PR/merge gate.
+- [x] Define that post-merge `master` CI must be checked on the promoted SHA.
+
+Exact branch and post-merge run IDs are intentionally recorded in PR/CI evidence and the session closeout response rather than in this file, because a self-referential evidence-only commit would move the candidate SHA and restart the qualification cycle.
